  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.01": "Evoker: We require more funds to buy books for the war effort",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.02": "Evoker: I propose we wage war on the villagers",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.03": "Evoker: We should increase taxes",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.04": "Evoker: Well.. I would like to suggest something",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.05": "Evoker: One simply cannot find decent sacrificial chalices these days",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.06": "Evoker: The vindicators' axe technique is frightfully common",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.07": "Evoker: These robes? Enchanted silk from the farlands.. you wouldn't understand",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.08": "Evoker: One doesn't simply cast spells.. one orchestrates arcane symphonies",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.09": "Evoker: My spell components are sourced exclusively from exotic biomes",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.10": "Evoker: My family has been in the dark arts for 17 generations",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.11": "Evoker: Have you not heard about that before?",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.12": "Evoker: That's polite",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.13": "Evoker: My vexes are restless in the void",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.14": "Evoker: We must go deeper into the deep dark",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.15": "Evoker: We must continue.. the research",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.16": "Evoker laughs",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.17": "Evoker: I sense a disturbance.. in the arcane energies",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.18": "Evoker: Well.. isn't that quite disturbing..?",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.19": "Evoker: Hmm.. what is this?",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.20": "Evoker: Alright, hmm..",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.21": "Evoker: Hmm.. fascinating",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.22": "Evoker: Apparently, one can summon vexes in Burgundy. How fashionable",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.23": "Evoker: This tome's margins are far too narrow for my annotations. peasants' publishing!",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.24": "Evoker: Hmm, these diagrams are exquisite!",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.25": "Evoker: We shall acquire a village.. by Tuesday..",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.26": "Evoker groans: The raid-planning committee requires my expertise",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.27": "Evoker: The pillagers.. will handle the crude work",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.28": "Evoker: Our expansion plan requires a more.. discerning approach to village acquisition",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.29": "Evoker: Costs a fortune, but one mustn't cut corners",
  "subtitles.illagerblabber.evoker.ambient_talk.30": "Evoker: My calendar is simply packed this week. Two raids, a summoning ritual, and a brunch with the other evokers",
